        "category": "classfeature",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your cosmo burns in your hands. Your fist deals 1d6 bludgeoning damage and is in the brawling group with the agile, finesse, nonlethal, and unarmed traits.</p><p>Your unarmed Strikes are <strong>magical</strong> and gain a <strong>+1 circumstance bonus to damage per weapon damage die</strong>.</p><p>At <strong>5th level</strong> your proficiency rank for unarmed attacks increases to expert, and you gain the <strong>brawling critical specialization</strong> effect.</p><hr /><p><strong>GM note:</strong> this is the built-in <em>handwraps of mighty blows</em> fix for a class with no weapons. Do not also require handwraps &mdash; that taxes the Saint twice.</p>"
        },
